service_psycho_pedagogical_desc:
- formation of life skills;
- development of cognitive, communication and behavioral abilities;
- support in studying and assimilating study programs;
- professional orientation;
- counseling and psychosocial rehabilitation of children;
- spending free time;
- facilitating access to community services (education, health, culture, etc.);
 - strengthening parenting skills in raising and educating children;

service_rehabilitation_desc:
illness, until the moment the child is taken over by the legal representative;
 daily epidemiological screening;
 ensuring children's nutrition with respect to legal norms in force;        conducting training sessions regarding basic notions and general knowledge in the field of health, prevention of communicable diseases, adoption of a healthy lifestyle, combating harmful habits, sexual education, according to the beneficiary's age and degree of maturity.
